               <div class="referenceLinkText"><a class="linkFunction" href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ajo.2009.01.023" target="linkout" data-target="CrossRef" data-id="CrossRef" data-url="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ajo.2009.01.023">Crossref</a><a class="linkFunction" href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/19375060" target="linkout" data-target="PubMed" data-id="PubMed" data-url="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/19375060">PubMed</a><a class="linkFunction" href="https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?title=Effectiveness of treatments for metastatic uveal melanoma&amp;publication_year=2009" target="linkout" data-target="Google Scholar" data-id="Google Scholar" data-url="https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookupEffectiveness of treatments for metastatic uveal melanoma">Search in Google Scholar</a></div><a href="/products/ejournals/ris/10.1055/a-1264-7962/id/R2176-27/BIB" class="referenceLinkRis" role="button" aria-label="Download RIS citation"><span class="visually-hidden">Download RIS citation</span></a></div>
